  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Ukraine Energy Support Fund - Phase III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Grant to the Energy Community Secretariat to enable contribution to the Ukraine Energy Support Fund. This fund will cover deliveries of equipment and materials required for the emergency repairs and other activities necessary for the stable functioning of the Ukrainian energy system.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
